Nutrition data
--------------
The 69 foods in seed/foods.json come from Memey_Diet_Planner_v3.xlsx, which
states they were validated against the Malaysian Food Composition Tables and
USDA SR Legacy.

The 78 chain and street foods in seed/viral-foods.json are estimates compiled
from public sources. They are labelled "est." in the app because real portions
vary between outlets.
